WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.810
- [Together] Three, two, one. Blastoff!

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:05.040
- I Draw, You Cook is back.

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:06.169
- It's gonna be fun, it's gonna be good.

00:00:06.169 --> 00:00:07.268
(hands slap, eggs crack, hammer bangs)

00:00:07.268 --> 00:00:08.151
(Rie and Alix yelp)

00:00:08.151 --> 00:00:08.984
(Katie hisses)

00:00:08.984 --> 00:00:09.817
- Oh my!

00:00:09.817 --> 00:00:10.800
- Little nervous, a little worried.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:12.540
- I don't bake whatsoever.

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:15.390
- The judges are kids,
so I know my audience.

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:16.650
- [Katie] Nice to meet you.

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:18.210
- Have you eaten a star before?

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:19.043
- Yes.

00:00:19.043 --> 00:00:19.876
- Oh, you did!

00:00:19.876 --> 00:00:21.330
- So what is magical water look like?

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:22.163
- Colorful.

00:00:22.163 --> 00:00:23.400
- Way out of my comfort zone.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:24.780
- [Alix] Gonna take some risks today.

00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:25.830
- Things could go wrong.

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.140
And I'm feeling so much
pressure right now.

00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:28.973
- I'm scared.

00:00:28.973 --> 00:00:30.187
- [Katie] Here we go. Here goes nothing.

00:00:30.187 --> 00:00:31.120
(baking pan plopping down)

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:32.010
(dough dropping)

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:32.843
- Dude!

00:00:32.843 --> 00:00:33.750
- I have a secret ingredient.

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:34.583
- Secret ingredient.

00:00:34.583 --> 00:00:36.030
- I've never used one of these before.

00:00:36.030 --> 00:00:37.530
It's always a great thing to say.

00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:38.363
- It's looking good.

00:00:38.363 --> 00:00:39.196
- You think that looks good?

00:00:39.196 --> 00:00:40.029
Look at that.

00:00:40.029 --> 00:00:41.310
- That looks radioactive.

00:00:41.310 --> 00:00:42.957
- Hope this was a good idea.

00:00:42.957 --> 00:00:46.148
(dramatic music)

00:00:46.148 --> 00:00:47.990
- [Together] Roar!

00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:48.823
- Let's go.

00:00:48.823 --> 00:00:50.008
- Let's do it.

00:00:50.008 --> 00:00:50.841
- What the!

00:00:50.841 --> 00:00:53.258
- May the best astronaut win.

00:00:54.749 --> 00:00:56.431
(music fades)

